@*
    Exception View  (dedicated full page)

    Route: /Practice/Index/exception-view?exceptionId=NNN

    PURPOSE
    -------
    exception-analysis.cshtml is the Pending-request ANALYSIS WORKFLOW
    (justification, proposed dates, remediation tasks, Submit for
    approval) -- it has no read-only "view mode", and Exception Centre's
    own row menu already disables its own link to that page once a
    request leaves Pending/SubmittedForApproval. There was, in effect,
    no working "View" for a Closed/Approved/Rejected exception. This
    page is that missing read-only full view, reachable in ANY status.

    It does not replace exception-analysis.cshtml and does not touch it
    -- Analysis stays exactly as it is, for exactly the Pending-request
    workflow it was built for.

    DATA SOURCES -- every one an existing API call, nothing new added:
      * Request detail -> GET /practice/api/exception-centre/{id}
                           (exception-analysis.js's own loadDetail())
      * History         -> GET /practice/api/exception-centre/{id}/history
                           (exception-analysis.js's own loadHistory())
      * Attachments      -> GET /practice/api/exception-centre/{id}/attachments
                           (already existed on the API; this is the
                           first screen to actually list them)
      * Related Tasks    -> GET /practice/api/exception-centre/{id}/tasks
                           (exception-analysis.js's own loadTasks())
      * Practice name    -> GET /practice/api/exception-centre/lookups/practices
                           (exception-analysis.js's own loadPracticeName())

    No duplicate business logic, no duplicate full-view page.

    ACTIONS MENU (change request, 2026-09-22): the "Actions" button below
    the heading offers the same items Exception Centre's row 3-dot menu
    does for this request -- Analysis, Approve (or the task-side SLA
    quick-approve), Open source gap -- built and gated by the exact same
    shared code Exception Centre itself now calls:
    window.gracExceptionActions.buildMenu() for the item list and every
    applicability/disabled rule, and openApprove()/openReject()/
    approveSlaQuick() for the decision itself. No action, navigation
    target or permission/applicability rule is re-implemented here -- see
    Shared/exception-actions.js's own header comment for the rules
    themselves. "View" is deliberately not offered: this page already IS
    the destination Exception Centre's "View" item opens, so buildMenu()
    is called without an onView handler and it is simply left out (the
    same reasoning Gap View and Task View apply to their own "View").

    "Analysis" lives ONLY here now (second pass, same day): this page
    used to also carry a standalone "Open Analysis" button beside
    Actions, navigating to the same exception-analysis.cshtml URL the
    menu's own Analysis item does -- but unconditionally, bypassing the
    disabled/status gate buildMenu() applies to that same item (Analysis
    only applies to a Pending or SubmittedForApproval request). That
    button was removed; the Actions menu is the one path in now, gated
    exactly like Exception Centre's own row menu gates it.

    The Approve/Reject dialogs the menu's Approve item opens are the
    SAME markup Exception Centre's row menu opens -- moved out of
    exception-centre.cshtml into the shared partial
    Partials/_exception-action-dialogs.cshtml so both screens include the
    one copy rather than each carrying their own. See that partial's own
    header comment.
*@
@model PracticeManagement.Web.Models.PracticeScreen

<div class="pm-page-heading compact">
    <div>
        <p class="pm-eyebrow">@Model.Group / @Model.Title</p>
        <h1 id="evHeading">Exception View</h1>
        <p class="pm-hint">Everything recorded for this exception request, read-only.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
        <button type="button" class="pm-button" id="evActionsBtn" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt" aria-hidden="true"></i> Actions
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:10px; margin-left:2px;"></i>
        </button>
        @* "Open Analysis" was a separate button here (change request,
           2026-09-22, second pass): removed, since it duplicated the
           "Analysis" item the Actions menu already offers -- and did so
           WITHOUT that item's own status gate, so it stayed clickable
           for an Approved/Rejected/Closed request when Exception Centre's
           own row menu (and the menu above) both grey that same item out.
           "Analysis" now has exactly one entry point, under Actions,
           gated exactly the way Exception Centre's row menu gates it. *@
        <a class="pm-button" href="~/Practice/Index/exception-centre">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Exception Centre
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

<partial name="Partials/_exception-action-dialogs" />

<section class="pm-panel" id="evUnavailable" hidden>
    <div class="pm-empty">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info pm-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2 id="evUnavailableTitle">Exception request not found.</h2>
        <p id="evUnavailableBody">Open this page from Exception Centre's row menu.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="pm-panel" id="evRoot" hidden>

    <div class="pm-toolbar" style="justify-content:space-between">
        <div>
            <span class="pm-badge" id="evStatusChip">-</span>
        </div>
        <button class="pm-button icon" id="evRefreshBtn" type="button" title="Refresh" aria-label="Refresh">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrows-rotate"></i>
        </button>
    </div>

    <h3 class="ev-section">Request Details</h3>
    <dl class="ev-facts" id="evFacts"></dl>

    <div id="evRelatedWrap" hidden>
        <h3 class="ev-section">Related</h3>
        <dl class="ev-facts" id="evRelatedFacts"></dl>
    </div>

    <div id="evReasonWrap" hidden>
        <h3 class="ev-section">Reason / Justification</h3>
        <dl class="ev-facts ev-facts-wide" id="evReasonFacts"></dl>
    </div>

    <div id="evValidityWrap" hidden>
        <h3 class="ev-section">Validity</h3>
        <dl class="ev-facts" id="evValidityFacts"></dl>
    </div>

    <div id="evApprovalWrap" hidden>
        <h3 class="ev-section">Approval</h3>
        <dl class="ev-facts ev-facts-wide" id="evApprovalFacts"></dl>
    </div>

    <div id="evEvidenceWrap">
        <h3 class="ev-section">Evidence <span class="pm-badge" id="evEvidenceCount"></span></h3>
        <p class="pm-hint" id="evEvidenceEmpty" hidden>No evidence recorded.</p>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap" id="evEvidenceTable" hidden>
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>File / Location</th><th>Type</th><th>Uploaded by</th><th>Uploaded</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="evEvidenceBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="evTasksWrap" hidden>
        <h3 class="ev-section">Related Tasks</h3>
        <div class="pm-table-wrap">
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Task #</th><th>Title</th><th>Status</th><th>Assigned To</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody id="evTasksBody"></tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="ev-section">History</h3>
    <p class="pm-hint">Every recorded action on this request, newest first.</p>
    <div class="pm-table-wrap">
        <table>
            <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Action</th><th>By</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="evHistoryBody"><tr><td colspan="4" class="pm-empty">Loading...</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

</section>

<style>
    #evRoot .ev-section {
        margin: 18px 0 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: #4a5568;
    }
    #evRoot .ev-facts {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 260px));
        gap: 8px 20px; margin: 0 0 4px;
        padding: 12px 14px; background: #f7fafc; border-radius: 6px;
    }
    #evRoot .ev-facts-wide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    #evRoot .ev-facts dt {
        font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; color: #718096;
    }
    #evRoot .ev-facts dd {
        margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #2d3748; overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
    #evRoot .ev-facts dd.ev-empty { color: #a0aec0; font-style: italic; }
    #evRoot .ev-facts dd.ev-block { white-space: pre-wrap; }
    .ev-hint { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; }
</style>

<script src="~/js/ExceptionCentre/exception-view.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
<script src="~/js/Shared/exception-actions.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
